{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310208001:1":{"text":"공...","source_cn":"殿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB682D238C132B9D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310208002:1":{"text":"쉿! 밖에선 그렇게 부르지 말라고 했잖아...","source_cn":"嘘！都说了出门不要这么叫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA1231768AA0363C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310208003:1":{"text":"크흠... 알레나 아가씨, 이렇게 돌아다니시는 건 위험합니다. 아버님께서 아시면 화내실 거예요...","source_cn":"咳……亚莲娜小姐，这样到处乱跑很不安全，您父亲知道了会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E261C9DA0A33CFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310208004:1":{"text":"에이, 괜찮아. 이번 한 번뿐인데 뭐.","source_cn":"哎呀，没关系的，就这一次嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x668DC8B7A24E45A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310208005:1":{"text":"부탁이야, 로드리고, 아버님껜 말하지 마, 알았지? 제발...","source_cn":"拜托了，罗德里戈，不要告诉我父亲好不好？求你了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12540B4165DFB5A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310208006:1":{"text":"하지만... 휴, 알겠습니다. 그렇지만 아버님께서도 곧 시더 마을에 도착하실 겁니다...","source_cn":"可是……唉，好吧。不过您父亲很快就要抵达雪松镇了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7B12E74B90B7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310208007:1":{"text":"...휴, 알겠어. 나도 아버지를 화나게 하고 싶지는 않으니까.","source_cn":"父亲……唉，好吧。我也不想让他生气呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32360433D9E4EB8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310208008:1":{"text":"귀여운 친구들, 우리 제전 때 다시 함께 놀아요!","source_cn":"几位可爱的朋友，咱们祭典的时候再一起玩吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32807D14A54BF0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310208009:1":{"text":"꼭 오셔야 해요!","source_cn":"你们可一定要来呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64E1C5B723D5B2B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310208010:1":{"text":"네네, 제전에서 다시 만나요!","source_cn":"嗯嗯，祭典的时候再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF452329612B8966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"근위대장 로드리고","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:红发少女